Z||000002||pherder||08-21-2000||06:08 PM||||I purchased the set (insert and bag) from him. It came packaged securely and quickly.<P>I ordered one for my 88 Coupe with the beechwood tan interior but forgot that I had changed the headliner to a lighter color.<P>Other then that, it fit perfectly.  I am a happy customer and if I get another sunroof, I will purchase another one. <P>The only thing it DOESN'T come with is the velco dots to secure it to the sunroof glass like the original did ... Not a problem ... just an observation.<P>Paul||||reg||14
